### 7) Corner case: 51 dias — fora da janela válida (0-50) -> HTTP 422
< {%
    const date = new Date();
    date.setDate(date.getDate() + 51);
    request.variables.set("transferDate", date.toISOString().split("T")[0]);
%}
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/transfers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "originAccount": "1111111111",
  "destinationAccount": "2222222222",
  "amount": 1000.00,
  "transferDate": "{{transferDate}}"
}

### 8) Corner case: data de transferência no passado -> HTTP 422
< {%
    const date = new Date();
    date.setDate(date.getDate() - 1);
    request.variables.set("transferDate", date.toISOString().split("T")[0]);
%}
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/transfers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "originAccount": "1111111111",
  "destinationAccount": "2222222222",
  "amount": 1000.00,
  "transferDate": "{{transferDate}}"
}

### 9) Corner case: conta de origem == conta de destino -> HTTP 422
### (ver ADR 0008)
< {%
    const date = new Date();
    request.variables.set("transferDate", date.toISOString().split("T")[0]);
%}
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/transfers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "originAccount": "1111111111",
  "destinationAccount": "1111111111",
  "amount": 1000.00,
  "transferDate": "{{transferDate}}"
}

### 10) Corner case: conta com menos de 10 dígitos -> HTTP 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/transfers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "originAccount": "123",
  "destinationAccount": "2222222222",
  "amount": 1000.00,
  "transferDate": "2026-08-01"
}

### 11) Corner case: valor zero/negativo -> HTTP 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/transfers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "originAccount": "1111111111",
  "destinationAccount": "2222222222",
  "amount": 0,
  "transferDate": "2026-08-01"
}

### 12) Corner case: campos ausentes -> HTTP 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/transfers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "originAccount": "1111111111"
}

### 13) Extrato final (deve listar todos os agendamentos aceitos acima)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/transfers

### H2 Console (usuário: sa, senha: em branco, JDBC URL: jdbc:h2:mem:transferscheduling)
GET {{baseUrl}}/h2-console
